  m_text: "Use left and right Joystick to switch between symbols and confirm input
    by pressing the action trigger.\nEach player has two symbols on the top of their
    controller, one is unique to them, and one is shared with the other player:\n\nPlayer
    1 \u2014 Sun (unique), Star (shared)\nPlayer 2 \u2014 Moon (unique), Star (shared)\n\nAll
    bottom symbols are shared between both players."
